[32m +[m
[32m +- HTML5, CSS, JavaScript[m
[32m +[m
[32m +[m
[32m +### Backend[m
[32m +[m
[32m +- PHP&#x20;[m
[32m +- MySQL[m
[32m +- XAMPP / Apache[m
